ce Minister Lars Klingbeil said state tax revenue will increase by €4 billion in 2027. Meanwhile, public service websites have been coming back online after a PHP security scare.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany arrests Ukrainian man suspected of spying for Russia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1026d9653e947ddbf9817cd52076c7c3ea444a37582db930486ad2d35379fa91</id><updated>2026-10-23T19:59:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T11:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-arrests-ukrainian-man-suspected-of-spying-for-russia/a-79732373--a3202cca0fcd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-arrests-ukrainian-man-suspected-of-spying-for-russia/a-79732373?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The suspect is thought to have gathered defense-related information on the production of tanks and munitions, as well as details about NATO's eastern flank.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German youth plan France-style mass protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a2a6ccadc0935ba045cf760464b5213e994179d7ce7dcca4adc6de2715ace656</id><updated>2026-10-23T19:59:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T23:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-youth-plan-france-style-mass-protests/a-79727133--417332c907bc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-youth-plan-france-style-mass-protests/a-79727133?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A youth-led movement in Germany has called for demonstrations in major cities of the country on October 31. The group has categorically distanced itself from the violence that took hold in France.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: AfD's Weidel calls for major EU reforms</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:58a3025f9167e033de93413d28c7243695b746c2b6952e82f854508722bb6f5d</id><updated>2026-10-23T19:59:56Z</update